sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Reader
  participant D as Dashboard / paper page
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant DB as Postgres + pgvector
  participant N as n8n Cloud
  participant AI as OpenAI + Jev
  R->>D: Switch "Formula 1" on
  D->>A: PUT /me/topics/motorsport
  A->>DB: save · stamp interests_changed_at
  A-->>N: signed event (reader, change time)
  Note over D: waits 0.9 s in case of more changes
  D->>A: POST /editions/refresh
  A->>DB: rank in SQL · stored summaries (no AI)
  A-->>D: new paper in the response (server ≈ 0.2 s)
  D->>R: new paper on screen ≈ 2.5 s after the click
  D->>A: POST /editions/polish
  A->>AI: missing summaries + AI editor
  A-->>D: polished paper ≈ 15 s later, swapped in silently
  N->>N: Wait 8 s
  N->>A: POST /internal/paper/check
  A-->>N: already up to date → skip
  Note over N,A: If the page was closed, n8n calls /internal/paper/refresh:<br/>fast reprint + polish run on the server, and the reader gets a notification
